WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.400
<i>Warning, multiple enemy units confirmed.</i>

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.960
<i>Enemy has landed a direct hit on Zegapain.</i>

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.490
<i>Heavy damage to unit!</i>
<i>Damage level increasing!</i>

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.460
<i>Transmission failure on emergency</i>
<i>support materialization pellet!</i>

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.870
<i>Emergency aid impossible!</i>

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.700
<i>Meta-body C.H.I.P. loss rate</i>
<i>entering danger zone.</i>

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.900
<i>Wet damage upon transmission recovery</i>
<i>and data restoration now unavoidable.</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.170
This is goodbye.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.310
Huh? What are you saying?

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.580
Wait! I'll stay to the very end!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.190
Kyo!

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.320
<i>Banishment mode, start.</i>

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:08.120
<i>Wizard transmission, commencing.</i>

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.800
Forgive me.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:42.090
I won't say goodbye to you ever again.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.490
I won't leave you all alone.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.500
C'mon, don't resist!

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:01.520
It's impossible!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.650
I QUIT!!!

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:04.620
Cut!

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:09.350
Kyo, what's the big idea?
The scene was going great!

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.030
What about it was "great"?!

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.260
I can't do this with Tomigai,
even if this is just a movie!

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:17.960
It's just too depressing thinking
my first kiss will be with a DUDE!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.200
I don't mind.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.700
Breach of contract!
After I bought your lunch, too!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.480
A man's allowed to break his
word three times in his life!

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.600
This is just my second time.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.140
Says who?

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:31.410
When and where'd you break
your word the first time?

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.380
Who cares?! Forget it...

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:44.450
That girl...

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.460
Forgive me, Kaminagi.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.690
Kyo Sogoru, where do
you think you're going?!

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.810
At last! At last! At last!

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:05.010
Get your clothes on! Sogoru!

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:06.520
You're breaking the dress code!

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:09.710
At last! At last!
The swim club's first new applicant!

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:19.760
Welcome! Welcome to the Maihama
Minami High School Swim Club!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:24.170
You wanna try out for the club?
Wow, this is really inspiring!

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.660
I'm Kyo Sogoru, class 1-D!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:30.570
The lone member of the swim club,
sacrificing his youth to master the pool!

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.470
I'm here to welcome you!
What's your name?

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:48.090
Huh? What'd you say?

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.790
Found him. Figured he'd be here.

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:58.000
Not bad!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.600
Hey!

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:00.090
Wha?

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:05.140
Uh-oh! Is she drowning?!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.640
What's up?

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.640
Him again.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.180
What's wrong with him?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.240
Something sure is.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.120
He gets good grades, but...

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.610
I'll take a pass on him.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:22.760
In short, the pretty girl suddenly
vanished from the pool...

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.660
and you're late to class because
you were looking for her?

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.500
I'm serious, Kurage!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.130
If I was lying, wouldn't
I make this more believable?

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.030
My name is Kurashige, not "Kurage."

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.400
Remember the swim club
faculty advisor's name, at least.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.510
Then as our advisor,
try being more understanding!

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.410
I'm the one trying to reform the club!

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.670
Can you just put on your clothes?

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.550
Of course!

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.560
Now what? Sogoru?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.050
What? Oh, no... It's nothing.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:06.100
<i>Brainstorm! I just got a great idea</i>
<i>how to kick start the swim club!</i>

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.380
Huh? Shoot a P.R. video for
the swim club? You mean me?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.880
Right! Featuring a
swimsuit girl who's a BABE!

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.580
One look at her and
the guys signing up will just...

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.210
POW! Simple and perfect!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.180
Simpleminded...

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.450
Guys <i>are</i> simpleminded!
Just look at me!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.960
It's totally stupid! I won't do it!

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:33.620
You just want to make a
cheesecake video or something!

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.800
No, because you're going to capture...

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:39.230
the true beauty of high school girls
in a fresh and wholesome way!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:43.260
I'm begging you, O future great
film director! Ryoko Kaminagi!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.280
So, who will be our model?
Tomigai, again?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.050
Oh, please! We'll use the girl
I saw at the pool before.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.050
The pool?

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.880
How's it going, Kyo?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.920
I hear the swim club's gonna be
disbanded for lack of members soon.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.360
Kawaguchi. Hayase. Ushio.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.090
Well, who'd want to join a club
that has you as a member?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.100
Oh, yeah?! You looking
for a fight today, pal?!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.470
And what's the big idea grabbing me?!

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:17.970
Lemme go, you ape!

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.770
You let <i>me</i> go, dumb ass!

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.880
Sogoru, no! Cut it out!

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.550
I said lemme go!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.740
Boy... Is he up to no good again?

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:31.350
- Kyo, after the crap you pulled in middle school,
- Mizuki...

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:34.620
- I am never, ever gonna forgive you!
- Cut it out, Kawaguchi. Let's go.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.090
The swim club is over, as of now!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.090
Shut yer damn mouth!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.700
Ryoko... Nice friends you got there.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.600
We grew up together.
I'm kinda stuck with him.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.240
I can't think of anyone like that.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:52.640
Not in the second or third year classes, either.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.640
Could she be a transfer student?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.480
I haven't heard about any.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.740
Then who did we see
at the pool today?

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.250
Maybe you saw a ghost in broad daylight.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.250
No way! She was real...

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:05.720
Um, Kyo?

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.560
What's all this?

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.290
There was no one there.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.460
Totally not what the weatherman said.
This really sucks!

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.270
Oh!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.270
Isn't he cute?

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.080
Maybe she was a ghost.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.270
Oh, just give it a rest already.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.240
Listen, Kaminagi...

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.310
There's not a soul out at all, huh?

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:37.690
It's raining.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:41.020
Anyway, you should worry about yourself instead.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.260
You've been weird since this afternoon.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:45.090
Maybe I have been, but...

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.360
There are no customers
or a shop keeper, either.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.140
How can it be raining today?

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:59.410
The weather's always clear for us.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:03.070
Looks like it won't be stopping
anytime soon. This is abnormal.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.590
Whew! I'm soaked to the bone!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:26.400
Get straight into the shower when
you get home! You don't want a cold!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.500
Same for you, Kyo.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.230
Sure!

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:34.040
From Dad. And this...

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.010
No return address...

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.790
What did you want to tell me?

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:21.720
Catch!

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.090
To make up for spoiling your shoot today.

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.360
Oh, sure. Like this is enough
to get my forgiveness.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:31.530
Okay, then I'll go scout locations
with you this Sunday.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:34.170
Just pick someplace
with water so I can swim.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.470
Are you a kappa?

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.010
<i>Put me in water and I'm happy as a clam!</i>

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.480
You really love swimming, don't you, Kyo?

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.980
<i>I guess.</i>

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.210
That's really tough.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:48.610
If you don't get more members by
summer break, they'll disband the club.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.320
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:54.120
<i>Those rumors from middle school</i>
<i>have followed me into high school.</i>

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.360
But, that's all just...

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.460
Look, don't worry about it!

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.650
It'll be fine once we get that girl in our video!

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.460
Save it...

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.930
Please, save this world.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:08.660
<i>I know! I know what</i>
<i>she wanted to tell me!</i>

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.000
<i>Hello?! Kyo?</i>

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.670
What's wrong, Kaminagi?

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.710
Be... Behind you...

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:31.110
What is all this?!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.760
My name is Shizuno in this place.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:44.060
So, you finally heard my voice.
Took you long enough.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.520
Are you a ghost?

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.530
See for yourself.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:00.880
This is!

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:05.250
I intended to give you a little more time
to recover, but that's not an option now.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.480
I have a favor to ask.
Will you hear me out?

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:12.050
To... save this world. Is that it?

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.260
Correct. Well?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.520
Well, will you do a P.R. video
for the swim club in return?

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.610
<i>Time to play the game.</i>

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:37.510
The game begins again.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.630
<i>Shift to Celebrant mode.</i>

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:52.620
<i>Reconstruction coordinates,</i>
<i>viewtrication parameters: set.</i>

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.960
<i>Bednorz curve, holding.</i>

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:58.540
<i>Transmission port energy compilation at 73%</i>

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.040
<i>85 seconds to full replenishment.</i>

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.210
<i>Quantum transmission core, A-OK.</i>

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:07.670
<i>Virtualization probability flux</i>
<i>now reaching 98 C.C.P.T.</i>

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.020
Commencing transmission. Entangle!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.570
A robot... Seriously?!

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.510
It's shining...

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.530
It's beautiful.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:55.360
Huh?

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:57.890
It just moved exactly the way I wanted it to.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.500
I know this feeling...

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:04.570
Okay, why am I so calm in this thing?

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.010
Because this isn't your
first time doing this, naturally.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.710
Welcome back to Zegapain.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.580
And you're?

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.110
Shizuno Misaki.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:15.780
So, how'd it feel to quantum teleport?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.290
May I ask you a question?

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.880
Just one. We haven't much time.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:24.280
Why were you at the pool this afternoon?

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.360
That's what you want to ask me now?

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.060
It's nothing really meaningful.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.370
I just wanted to take a swim.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.530
I never imagined you'd spot me.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:36.560
I was thinking of meeting you
if circumstances allowed, but...

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:43.300
Just trust me, Kyo.
Do as I say and you'll be fine.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:49.440
This is the latest in virtual reality games.
Think of it like that for now.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:50.980
Okay?

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.150
That's impossible!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.950
Oh, well...
Guess we'll have to talk later.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:58.790
Enemy!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.200
<i>Gards-orm, approaching from ahead.</i>

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.960
<i>Air squadron of thirteen Ulvorful units.</i>

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.860
<i>He spotted them quickly.</i>

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:11.170
<i>Your mission is to support</i>
<i>the Zegatank's operation...</i>

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.740
<i>and to wipe out</i>
<i>the Gards-orm mobile squadron.</i>

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.370
Your operational time limit
is 6 minutes, 12 seconds.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:17.940
Ready to go?

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.280
If you agree to be in my video.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.850
Okay.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:31.990
Zegapain Altair, activate!

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:57.770
It's bouncing off!

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.620
Holonic armor. Light shields.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.520
A half-assed attack like this
won't affect Zegapain!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.860
They're here! What do I do?!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.360
Altair is directly linked to your thoughts!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.590
Think how <i>you</i> would react!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:40.660
This thing... It can fly, too?

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.560
Do you like it?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.060
Yeah!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.300
Hey!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.800
Do you need weapons?

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.740
If you got any, lemme have 'em!

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.210
Guns? A sword?

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:51.900
Sword!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:54.070
Roger that!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:58.180
Front grip weapon chamber coil activation, okay.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:01.540
Holonic blade, deploying. Right hand!

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.430
Not bad at all!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:53.300
A bit unsteady, perhaps.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.700
Speaking personally,
I'm afraid I just can't agree...

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.810
with the decision you've made in this matter.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:59.740
You'll be disciplined for this!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:02.640
What happens if we lose the Altair
right after it's been tuned up?

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:04.910
There's a risk. I admit that.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:08.180
<i>Like hitting a broken TV set?</i>
<i>That isn't like you.</i>

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:11.670
You mind not hanging over my
head and bitching at us right now?!

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.980
Three left! Gimme guns!

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:23.430
Can't hit 'em!

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:25.660
Focus your mind on your own forehead.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.810
It's over!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:47.190
The enemy's spotted Zegatank!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.290
Should we save it?!

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:50.310
If we can.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.320
We can do it!

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:06.370
Lu-shen!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.680
We'll escape when the
data salvage is complete.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:09.770
Zero-nine to go...

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.680
An Aanval!

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:14.220
How much Q.L. is left?

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:15.480
320.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.420
15 seconds of hand-to-hand mode.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:29.760
Zegapain Altair!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.170
It's working?!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.600
<i>Zegatank, fall back to the Oceanus!</i>

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.830
Shizuno. Who's acting as your Gunner?

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:39.240
Kyo Sogoru?!

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:46.010
Okay...

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:46.980
Aim for its core!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.350
<i>Warning! Vehicle's...</i>

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.130
Wings!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:19:59.860
Roger.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.420
Light wings, full deploy!

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.320
<i>We're at transmission limit.</i>
<i>Returning to ship.</i>

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.320
Mission complete. Entangle, time out.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.810
<i>Entangle, time out.</i>

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:48.400
Zegapain...

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.490
<i>Welcome back, Kyo.</i>

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:56.400
It's impossible! Nobody knows that girl?!

00:22:56.400 --> 00:22:58.710
I didn't dream it and I didn't imagine it!

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:01.140
I can feel how real these memories are!

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:02.910
I'll keep my promise.

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:06.550
You basically just want me
to beat these guys, right?!

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.880
I want to see this through!

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:12.110
Where are you now, Shizuno Misaki?

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.710
Next time, on Zegapain: "Cerebrum."

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:18.490
My thoughts, never to be erased.
